; ZETA RAYS: keyboard shortcuts of the file manager (Thunar 4.20).
; Space = Quick Look on the selected file (custom action zeta-quicklook in
; uca.xml), like on macOS. Thunar gives keys to a focused text field first
; (location bar, search, rename), so Space still types a space there.
(gtk_accel_path "<Actions>/ThunarActions/uca-action-zeta-quicklook" "space")
